            "`bar_pred`：谓词"
          ],
          "why": "自反说的是自己和自己可比，`foo_lemma` 正是这条。",
          "tags": [
            "fixture",
            "lemma"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "cards": [
        {
          "id": "fixture-card",
          "oneLiner": "夹具卡",
          "definition": {
            "lang": "lean",
            "code": "theorem foo_lemma (α : Type) (A : Set α) : A ⊆ A\n\ndef bar_pred (α : Type) (x : α) : Prop := True"
